  "Software Details": "تفاصيل البرامج",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "يمكنك إدارة قائمة مطعمك بسهولة باستخدام Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/شهر",
  "/Year": "/سنة",
  "Buy Now": "اشتري الآن",
  "View Live Demo": "عرض تجريبي مباشر",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "العروض الديناميكية والترقيات",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "عزز مبيعاتك واجذب المزيد من العملاء من خلال ميزة إدارة العروض لدينا. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "ترتيبات الجدول الفعالة",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "قم بتحسين مساحة تناول الطعام الخاصة بك وتبسيط عملياتك من خلال ميزة ترتيب الطاولة لدينا. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "التخصيص والتحديثات في الوقت الحقيقي",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "قم بتخصيص قائمتك لتناسب الهوية الفريدة لمطعمك باستخدام أدوات إنشاء السمات والفئة الخاصة بنا. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "تعزيز مشاركة العملاء",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "انتقل بخدمة العملاء الخاصة بك إلى المستوى التالي باستخدام أدوات إدارة العملاء لدينا. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "تحديثات الواجهة الأمامية في الوقت الحقيقي",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "باستخدام Dash SaaS، فإن أي تغييرات تجريها على القائمة أو العروض أو ترتيبات طاولة الطعام تكون مرئية على الفور في الواجهة الأمامية. ",
